#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""vcs-py: every vcs subcommand, in Python 3 with only the standard library.

The portable counterpart of the Go vcs, vcs-git, vcs-hg, vcs-jj and vcs-p4
binaries, for machines that can't run them. The `vcs` shell script beside
this file handles what a prompt runs and hands everything else here.

Usage: vcs-py [--vcs=NAME] [--hg-path=PATH] [-n|--dry-run] <subcommand> [args...]
"""

